        "We observe that dialogues are in general much longer than profiles. We also observe that a doctor engages in over 300 dialogues on average. It indicates that rich information are contained in dialogues to learn doctor expertise, while presenting challenges to capture the essential content therein for effective doctor embedding.\n",
