            "    \n",
            "\\end{figure}\n",
            "\n",
            "\n",
            "\\paragraph{Sensitivity to Dialogue Length.}\n",
            "We then study the model sensitivity to the length of dialogues for doctor modeling and show the results in Figure \\ref{fig:sens-dialog}.\n",
            "Dialogue length exhibits similar effects to query length, possibly because they contribute homogeneous features to understand doctor-patient match. After all, other patients' queries are part of the dialogues and involved in learning doctor expertise. \n",
            "\n",
